<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-14T21:51:02.179Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:51:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian federal forces have seized the strategic Tigray town of Adwa and its airport near the Eritrean border, while a pro-government militia also reports taking the airport. Ethiopian drones have struck Eritrean troops that entered Ethiopian territory to support Tigrayan rebels, and heavy weapons are being moved toward the Eritrean border. The United Nations has allocated $8.5 million for humanitarian response as the conflict escalates in northern Ethiopia. Ethiopia and Somaliland are discussing defense cooperation. The war caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQb2FQTWlGMzdwSWxvMmdvRDNvc290Qkk2bnpjbkxIaU5UZUVrXzZPbWgzR3JuQ2dPOXkyYlk1VjhMNl8teWJ3aE41UFFLS0pnYlB1ZGEwS0lPYzJYcWRkVjZwdkw3NEgtUXFwZm5jdDd3cXVxdlZCMnEwTDNway1tZmZtMXhjWFl0RmtOTlFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPS2xYb3JZZjd5V0VSaTNTNUlIQ3haLUZjdDhXSllpU3Z6VTg0SkVIUjkwRWJNZ0o2aXZtQTNxSUdHX0VpNUFaMlphS1lkNGZ2X1I0VzVYNUhRMFlhTUVYM3FGQkR5UTkxWmFVREhyZ1dMNTYwQmZmeGhZa3BpQ3FYbWEyTy1HdHNSdEE3UnBWdW45WmFyTm5jYVJjUng?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE5HUGhqbHpRd0poZ1FuY0NQNHVHYlc0S3Y4Rzh5ejJfWDFYbG5Ja1V6TnhFdEg3bUkzRVN6YnkxckVNVmc0UGczVjdWVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNVHpfWGJack4zVGhWaEh2Wl95YVFhVGlqdWtkNzBiSktXbjB2UElNWUpDYXJra28zMThFVnNkUWowMHlmVzhjLWxVLVZacUR1MFY2WEVvUXZNQnVDZkkxN2VNZmhzT1dYUHE1UFVMd0RqaVNTaU1aU1VnR1hxRDhjRUVPV04?oc=5&quot;&gt;조선일보&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOWDg4Rm1Tb2IxSVVHdWEycVpTODAzc3Q